---
import ProjectLayout from '../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import OptimizedImage from '../components/OptimizedImage.astro';
---
<ProjectLayout title="Manufacturing Projects" heading="IME 141, 142 & 143 - Manufacturing Projects">
  <p>Four selected projects from hands-on manufacturing courses at Cal Poly. Courses included IME 141 Net Shape, IME 142 Materials Joining, and IME 143 Material Removal. Projects in clockwise order:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Drake Medallion: Investment casting (Lost wax)</li>
    <li>Mustang: Sand casting</li>
    <li>Screw driver with bit storage: Turning • Facing • Knurling • Tapping • CNC Mill</li>
    <li>Doohickey: CNC Mill</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="images"><OptimizedImage source="IME/ime.png" alt="Four manufacturing projects: a Drake medallion, a Mustang, a screwdriver, and a machined doohickey" loading="eager" /></div>
</ProjectLayout>
